<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\隠れる草むら1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"It's okay, looks like we got away."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We were hiding ourselves in the tall grass.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There weren't even any streetlights, and the moonlight was hidden by the thick leaves of the trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The road nearby was a narrow one that a single car could barely get through.</STYLE><PG>
"Daaamn, why won't Dad listen to me!
{PAUSE ""}
　Hey, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> shouted into her phone under her breath, but as before, there was no response at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Dammit, and the battery's about to die, too... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, turn on <STYLE ID="3">your</STYLE> phone."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then, a strong wind raged across the whole area.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\能面フラッシュ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n0\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! Look out!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MOTION "春花突き飛ばし" "人物1" "3" "960" "200" "NORMAL" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\鉈峰うち.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "-180" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n鉈振りおろし\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n480\r\n200\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n鉈振りおろし\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n480\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "SE\剣衝突.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1,111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "300" "50"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "17!" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "escape2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\隠れる草むら1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The instant I shoved </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> away, a </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="なた">nata</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> plunged into that very spot.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Damn! This way, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュずれ用.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">We started running again.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\haa1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hah... hah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Running on the mountain road had, not surprisingly, started to wear me out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, was this just simple fatigue?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If this was that...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\隠れる草むら2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"We're okay here, there's no way we'll be in its line of sight."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Holding in our ragged breathing, we crouched in the grass again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The wind kept raging, and the cherry blossoms were whirling down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At that moment, my intuition gave me a warning―no, handed down a judgment.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That there was no way out anymore. That escaping was impossible.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just then, footsteps from in front―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The shinigami...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even though we were completely hidden, </STYLE>
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">it was coming straight toward us.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\lcm\死神近づく.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
"What is that thing...! How does it know where we are!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">No matter where we hid, the shinigami pinpointed exactly where we were and came right after us.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Once you've been cursed, it chases you wherever you go.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That is death, and the shinigami who governs death.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, that's wrong! That thing is just someone in disguise, using some trick!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A shinigami? That's as far-fetched as it gets!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That one, like this, in the past, as many as six people...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And now... even </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">my dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>! Let's hurry to the wide road! Hiding's no good!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュずれ用.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> took my hand again, and started running.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My legs already felt like lead, but I couldn't stop here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I stopped, even </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> would fall prey to the shinigami.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Because earlier, the shinigami had tried to slash </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> with the nata.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But, as I thought, this didn't seem to be simple fatigue.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Yes, I have an illness peculiar to this time of year.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And it had started to set in at the worst possible time.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュずれ用.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "500" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "10000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\山車道反転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―Running down the narrow asphalt mountain road, colored by a storm of cherry petals.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It looked like there was still quite a distance to the wide road.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ギン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "15" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\山車道反転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "15" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ギン.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "15" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\山車道反転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "15" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">, sorry...! Wait!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"What's wrong!? If you're tired, lean on my shoulder!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That too, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">at a time like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Don't tell me... your April sickness..." [TN: A pun on gogatsu-byo, 'May sickness,' Japan's term for the May blues.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That distinctive dizziness, and the drained feeling.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Having nothing wrong with me all day today, that had been the abnormal part.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\山車道.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">There was no sign of anything following from behind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">On one side was a high rock wall, on the other a cliff, so there was no route the shinigami could come by except from behind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The road was as narrow as ever, though...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\山車道反転.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">, get away by yourself..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Are you an idiot! I told you I'd protect you, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, no matter what!
{PAUSE ""}
　Besides, Dad's after me too. Getting away by myself would come to the same thing!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルト歩くずれ用.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> put my arm over her shoulder and started walking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> had to be pretty exhausted, too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, the shinigami too, carrying those weapons, had to be pretty worn out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It probably couldn't come after us very fast.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">... for causing you trouble even at a time like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"When you get down to it, it's because I told you not to go to the police... 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm the one who dragged you into this... No matter how many times I got down on my knees and bowed, it wouldn't make up for it..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">... do you still think it was your dad, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">, who appeared because of the curse?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I wonder about that... 
{PAUSE ""}
Actually, I'm starting to think something's a little off. 
{PAUSE ""}
I thought it had come to kill <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, but it's weirdly dragging things out, or something; it won't try to kill right away. 
{PAUSE ""}
And, just now, it tried to cut me with the nata too. 
{PAUSE ""}
If it's Dad... what's he thinking..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If it had that monstrous strength and a way to pin down exactly where we were, killing us would probably be no trouble at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Why such a roundabout way? Was it enjoying the crime?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, if I hadn't shoved </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> away earlier, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> would have been killed.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, you were feeling good all day today, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah... sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, that's not it, I'm not blaming you. 
{PAUSE ""}
I got to thinking. Maybe what brings on <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>'s April sickness attacks isn't just the cherry blossoms..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What do you mean...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"About today's weather..."
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
"It's <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE>Hello!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you alive!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Somehow... Technically, not a scratch."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s breathing had gotten quite ragged.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I sank down right where I was.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"We'll be there soon too! It'll still take... 40 minutes, though... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Oh, but the local police should get there in about 10 minutes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"10 minutes, huh... But no matter how far down the mountain we go, the mountain road doesn't end..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"If you go about 2 kilometers down the road along Sakuraoka Station, the road suddenly opens up and there should be a convenience store. Run in there!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
